        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Syndra knocks enemies and Dark Spheres back dealing magic damage. Enemies hit by Dark Spheres become stunned.",
        "bodyHtml": "Syndra projects a wave of force, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocking Back</span> enemies and <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dark Spheres</span> and dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/95/130/165/200 + (60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dark Spheres</span> that are pushed <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stun</span> enemies for 1.25 seconds and deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/95/130/165/200 + (60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span>80 Splinters of Wrath</span>: This Ability's width is increased and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> enemies by <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">70%</span> for 1.25 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Enemies can only take damage and be Knocked Back from this Ability once per cast.<br /></span>",
